    "Source": "\/*\r\n    Author or source: antoinec <antoine.champion+dsp@outlook.fr>\r\n*\/\r\n\r\n\/* Shelving filter (2nd order)\r\n * Boost\/cut all the frequencies above or below the cutoff\r\n * Equivalent to gain * lowpass + highpass transfer function *\/\r\n\r\n\r\nfloat zIn[2] = {0};\r\nfloat zOut[2] = {0};\r\n\nformula_main {\r\n    float frequency = exp(2.3 + KNOB_1 * 7.6);\r\n    float w = 2 * M_PI * frequency \/ SAMPLE_RATE;\n    float Q = 0.005 + KNOB_2 * 2.5;\r\n    float gain = -8 + KNOB_3 * 16;\r\n    gain = pow(10, gain * 0.05);\r\n    \r\n    float cw = cos(w);\r\n    float G = 1\/sqrt(gain);\r\n    float alpha = G * cw;\r\n    float beta = sin(w) * sqrt(G) \/ Q;\r\n    \r\n    int isHighShelf = SWITCH_1;\r\n    float a0, a1, a2, b0, b1, b2;\r\n    if (isHighShelf) {        \r\n        a0 = G+1 - alpha + cw + beta;\r\n        a1 = 2 * (G-1 - alpha - cw);\r\n        a2 = G+1 - alpha + cw - beta;\r\n        b0 = G * (G+1 + alpha - cw + beta);\r\n        b1 = -2*G * (G-1 + alpha + cw);\r\n        b2 = G * (G+1 + alpha - cw - beta);\r\n    \r\n    } else {\r\n        a0 = G+1 + alpha - cw + beta;\r\n        a1 = -2 * (G-1 + alpha + cw);\r\n        a2 = G+1 + alpha - cw - beta;\r\n        b0 = G * (G+1 - alpha + cw + beta);\r\n        b1 = 2*G * (G-1 - alpha - cw);\r\n        b2 = G * (G+1 - alpha + cw - beta);\r\n    }\r\n        \r\n    \r\n    float output = a0*input + a1*zIn[0] + a2*zIn[1];\r\n    output -= b1*zOut[0] + b2*zOut[1];\r\n    output \/= b0;\r\n    \r\n    zIn[1] = zIn[0]; zIn[0] = input;\r\n    zOut[1] = zOut[0]; zOut[0] = output;\r\n    \n    return output;\n}\n",
